{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":15.92},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.12,"end":31.36},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":33.28,"end":44}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":4,"text":"工程檢查要區分已驗證和仍未知的條件。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.72,"end":6.88,"text":"切線相同是有用的證據，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.24,"end":12.08,"text":"但乘坐舒適度還取決於曲率、速度與作用力。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.72,"end":13.6,"text":"記下設定，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":13.733,"end":15.92,"text":"以及模型沒有涵蓋的限制。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.12,"end":19.92,"text":"選擇較緩的彎曲與匹配的接點，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.32,"end":23.04,"text":"讓 x 掃過接點並保存設計。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.92,"end":27.6,"text":"說明真實設施還需要哪一項物理檢查。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":29.2,"end":31.36,"text":"這項幾何檢查能確立什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":33.28,"end":35.76,"text":"這項幾何檢查能確立什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":37.04,"end":40.88,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":41.52,"end":44,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}